      "sourceTextSha256": "abc2a44c5889f27eda85ae5f8fc125b59b504dd61bdf0f3b0e7beeb8692218f6",
      "text": "Celebrate New Year on Copacabana, visit both sides of the Iguazu Falls, spend two days at a lodge in the Amazon jungle and unwind in Búzios. This group tour runs from 30 December 2026 to 10 January 2027: 12 days and 11 nights. English-speaking guides lead the excursions in Rio and Iguazu, and an English-speaking guide accompanies you in the Amazon.",
